{
  "_": [
    "docs/design/FLOOR.md § 4.6 — THE ONE STATEMENT of how a layout and the installs the fleet",
    "reports compose into floors. Two runtimes implement it — App\\Building\\Building::compose()",
    "for the admin console and public/js/lobby/lobby-model.js floors() for the lobby — and both",
    "are held to every case here (Tests\\Feature\\Building, Tests\\Feature\\Lobby). A case is the",
    "RAW authored document (a list of floor records, each carrying its `rooms` and optionally its",
    "`label` — card#9273), the installs the fleet reports, and the floors that must come out:",
    "floor keys ascending, each floor's `label` (null where the layout names no label, and null on",
    "every implicit floor), rooms by install ascending, `reported` per room.",
    "Add a case here and both suites gain it; a rule that lives in one runtime and not the other",
    "is what this file exists to red."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "the empty layout is today's building: one floor per install, open",
      "layout": [],
      "installs": ["sola", "aimla"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "label": null, "rooms": [{"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true}]},
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [{"install": "sola", "form": "open", "reported": true}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the operator's hallway: two solo installs composed onto one floor, keyed by the least room",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"zeta": "office", "sola": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["zeta", "sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the operator's mixed floor: one open PM+impl room and two offices on one floor",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"sola": "office", "aimla": "open", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["aimla", "sola", "zeta"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two PM+impl rooms on one floor, and a second floor of offices",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"mira": "open", "nova": "open"}}, {"rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["nova", "mira", "zeta", "sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "mira", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "mira", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "nova", "form": "open", "reported": true}
        ]},
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an install the layout does not place gets a floor of its own, open, and sorts among the composed ones",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola", "zeta", "aimla"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "label": null, "rooms": [{"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true}]},
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a room the fleet reports nothing for is drawn on its floor and flagged, never omitted",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": false}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a floor none of whose rooms report is still a floor",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": [],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": false},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": false}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a one-room floor is worth authoring only for its form",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"sola": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "label": null, "rooms": [{"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an all-digit install id survives the integer-key cast in both runtimes",
      "layout": [{"rooms": {"42": "open", "7": "open"}}],
      "installs": ["42", "7"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "42", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "42", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "7", "form": "open", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a labelled floor carries its label and is still keyed by its least room (card#9273)",
      "layout": [{"label": "the solos", "rooms": {"zeta": "office", "sola": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola", "zeta"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "label": "the solos", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a labelled floor beside a composed floor the operator did not name: the second's label is null",
      "layout": [
        {"label": "the solos", "rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}},
        {"rooms": {"mira": "open", "nova": "open"}}
      ],
      "installs": ["sola", "zeta", "mira", "nova"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "mira", "label": null, "rooms": [
          {"install": "mira", "form": "open", "reported": true},
          {"install": "nova", "form": "open", "reported": true}
        ]},
        {"floor": "sola", "label": "the solos", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a labelled floor beside an unplaced install: the implicit floor has no label to carry",
      "layout": [{"label": "the solos", "rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola", "zeta", "aimla"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "aimla", "label": null, "rooms": [{"install": "aimla", "form": "open", "reported": true}]},
        {"floor": "sola", "label": "the solos", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "§ 4.6's residual: a label equal to an UNPLACED install's id reads the same on two floors, and neither runtime refuses it or disambiguates it",
      "layout": [{"label": "nova", "rooms": {"sola": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola", "nova"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "nova", "label": null, "rooms": [{"install": "nova", "form": "open", "reported": true}]},
        {"floor": "sola", "label": "nova", "rooms": [{"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a label equal to its own floor's key is allowed and changes nothing about the floor",
      "layout": [{"label": "sola", "rooms": {"sola": "office", "zeta": "office"}}],
      "installs": ["sola", "zeta"],
      "floors": [
        {"floor": "sola", "label": "sola", "rooms": [
          {"install": "sola", "form": "office", "reported": true},
          {"install": "zeta", "form": "office", "reported": true}
        ]}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
